{"title": "Arrow of Arcane Interference", "pageid": 11799, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference", "categories": ["Arrows", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png/300px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f7/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Arrow of Arcane Interference image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png/300px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Arrow of Arcane Interference</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">Arrow</a>) item that can be fired from a Ranged <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon\">Weapon</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>To disrupt the Weave is to draw <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra's</a> wrath - if her casters can catch you.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Ammunition_Icon.png/25px-Ammunition_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Ammunition_Icon.png/38px-Ammunition_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/99/Ammunition_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Arrows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Ammunition_Icon.png/25px-Ammunition_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Ammunition_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">Arrows</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-